// The function-entry prelude: work counting (harness builds only), then the
// call-recording hook for a function named by a `calls` clause
// (test/unit/more/rec/call.id) -- the same is_harn() gate, at a different
// point in the body.

emit_entry(int id) {
  emit_count("    ");
  emit_rec_call(id);
} return void;
